{"id":"vod_sn_36041","vodId":"36041","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"贤者之孙","name_cn":"贤者之孙","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3aa82bf7844b842a1fe0ddc7402023e6.jpg"},"summary":"一位平凡的青年，在一场可怕的交通事故中丧生，误打误撞下竟然转生来到了异世界里，并被一位自称是贤者的法师梅林（屋良有作 配音）给捡回了家，梅林给这个孤零零的孩子取名为西恩（小林裕介 配音），开始教授他使用魔法。　　一晃眼15年过去了，西恩从一个嗷嗷待哺的婴儿成长为了有为青年，名师出高徒，在师父严厉的教导之下，西恩已经拥有了非常强大的力量。当西恩决定进入亚尔斯海特高等魔法学院继续深造之时，梅林才发现，这么多年来，他一直只教西恩魔法，竟然忘记了规训他的常识，这也就意味着，西恩即将在对常识一窍不通的情况下进入学校和同龄人们开始集体生活。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/S3i3ZN1yvZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UhZY5hD00k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4gAMU6u2Sj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nFnEnZbQxu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0qHFMnu7Wr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HiX6KmkTQK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FqZDwkbpi41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U6dzDGnYne1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/st7LMR9jBG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kBmy6NUX9h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gcbEMTkMGv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F6ScFS40u31/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:27.521Z"}